OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with clear periods
OL,8,Fand variable amounts of cloud. Light
OL,9,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FMainly dry with variable
OL,12,Famounts of cloud and bright spells.
OL,13,FCloudier in the afternoon with the
OL,14,Fchance of a light shower in the east.
OL,15,FWarm along the west coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
