OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry on Wednesday and Thursday although
OL,7,Fsome showers possible at times.
OL,8,FCloudier on Friday with showers and
OL,9,Fchance of more persistent rain, most
OL,10,Flikely in the east.
